    "It runs on %@ after the current reply. If it has already started, nothing changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es läuft nach der aktuellen Antwort auf %@. Wenn es schon gestartet ist, ändert sich nichts."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se ejecuta en %@ después de la respuesta actual. Si ya empezó, no cambia nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il s’exécute sur %@ après la réponse en cours. S’il a déjà démarré, rien ne change."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在の返信の後に %@ で実行されます。すでに開始している場合は何も変わりません。"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ele roda em %@ depois da resposta atual. Se já tiver começado, nada muda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会在当前回复结束后在 %@ 上运行。如果已经开始，则不会有任何变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its shell stops, on the computer too.": {
